---
// V3 專業商務風格 - Speed Test Section
---

<section class="bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Speed Test Demo -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="card-pro p-6">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">速度測試結果</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Speedtest by Ookla</p>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-success">測試完成</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Speed Gauge -->
          <div class="text-center mb-8">
            <div class="relative w-56 h-28 mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 200 100">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="v3GaugeGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#1E40AF" />
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#3B82F6" />
                  </linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <!-- Background arc -->
                <path
                  d="M20,100 A80,80 0 0,1 180,100"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#E2E8F0"
                  stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                />
                <!-- Progress arc -->
                <path
                  d="M20,100 A80,80 0 0,1 165,40"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="url(#v3GaugeGradient)"
                  stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                />
              </svg>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-center pb-2">
                <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">312.5</span>
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-500 ml-1 mb-1">Mbps</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Detailed Stats -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1">下載</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">312.5</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mbps</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1">上傳</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">45.2</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mbps</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl">
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1">延遲</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">12</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">ms</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Leaderboard -->
          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">社群排行榜</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-[#1E40AF] font-medium cursor-pointer hover:underline">全部排名 →</span>
            </div>
            <div class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
              {[
                { rank: 1, name: '新加坡', speed: '892.3 Mbps', isp: 'StarHub', medal: '🥇' },
                { rank: 2, name: '韓國', speed: '845.1 Mbps', isp: 'KT Corporation', medal: '🥈' },
                { rank: 3, name: '台灣（你）', speed: '312.5 Mbps', isp: 'Chunghwa Telecom', medal: '🥉', isYou: true }
              ].map((user) => (
                <div class={`flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3 ${user.isYou ? 'bg-[#1E40AF]/5' : ''}`}>
                  <span class="text-xl">{user.medal}</span>
                  <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                    <div class="font-medium text-slate-900">{user.name}</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">{user.isp}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-right">
                    <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900">{user.speed}</div>
                    {user.isYou && <span class="text-[10px] text-[#1E40AF] font-medium">你的成績</span>}
                  </div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
        <span class="badge badge-primary mb-4">專業測速</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          精準的速度測試
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          整合 Speedtest by Ookla CLI，提供企業級的網路速度測試功能。測試結果可選擇性上傳至社群排行榜，與全球用戶進行比較。
        </p>

        <!-- Feature list -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#1E40AF]/5 text-[#1E40AF] rounded-lg flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">專業測速引擎</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">採用 Ookla 官方 CLI，確保測試結果準確可靠</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#1E40AF]/5 text-[#1E40AF] rounded-lg flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">多維度排行榜</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">支援全球、國家、ISP 三種排行榜維度比較</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#1E40AF]/5 text-[#1E40AF] rounded-lg flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">隱私優先設計</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">上傳測試結果為可選功能，完全尊重用戶隱私</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
